flickos-recovery (1.3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Restore points made by an apt command with options (apt-get -o
    NAME=VALUE install …) are named after the packages again, not after
    the options' values: asked_for skips the value of -o, -c, -t and
    apt's other options that take one, and takes apt's command from the
    first word that isn't an option.

